# Runtime state written by the MCP server when STATE_DIR isn't set and cwd
# happens to be the repo (happens during smoke tests). Real usage puts
# these in ~/.claude-image-tts-gen/. Patterns are anchored to repo root
# with a leading slash — unanchored, `batch/` / `cache/` / `presets/`
# also matched `mcp-server/dist/batch/` etc. and silently excluded the
# compiled batch module from git, breaking plugin installs (the GitHub
# release tarball shipped without those files). See CHANGELOG v0.8.10.
/session.json
/budget.json
/presets/
/batch/
/cache/
/projects/

